cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reference its results, please cite the accompanying thesis."
title: "SAH-RAG: Structure-Aware Hierarchical Hybrid Retrieval for Long-Context RAG Systems"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and evaluation framework for SAH-RAG, a
  structure-aware, hierarchical, hybrid retrieval architecture for
  Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems in long-context scenarios.
  The work includes a fair-comparison protocol applied to four heterogeneous
  legal corpora (CLERC, CUAD, GreekBarBench, LaRA) against LongRAG and
  Metadata-RAG under a shared canonical dataset envelope.
